cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "AURIS simulator: open hybrid ear-surgery simulator"
abstract: >-
  Open hybrid ear-surgery simulator (DC15) of the AURIS Marie Skłodowska-Curie
  Doctoral Network (Advanced Ultra-precise Robotic Inner-ear Surgery), built on
  the SOFA framework, for testing and comparing robotic instruments and
  cochlear-implantation strategies.
